WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.374 --> 00:00:05.790
KELSEY DOMME: The
Cloud Sales Role

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:08.020
has been such an
amazing journey.

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.410
It's just really exciting
what we get to do every day.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:12.327
We talk with all different
kinds of customers.

00:00:12.327 --> 00:00:14.618
JAMIE SHARP: The role gives
you quite a lot of freedom.

00:00:14.618 --> 00:00:16.750
The ultimate goal
isn't just revenue,

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.287
but it's actually
customer success.

00:00:18.287 --> 00:00:19.620
KELSEY DOMME: We're outreaching.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.640
You're trying to
break new accounts.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.930
But you're also dealing with
accounts that are already

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:27.430
using Google Cloud
Platform and G Suite

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:30.130
and asking them, hey,
how's it going, providing

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.404
that white glove
treatment to really

00:00:32.404 --> 00:00:34.570
make sure they have the
best experience with Google.

00:00:34.570 --> 00:00:36.861
JAMIE SHARP: My favorite
example of that is Pokemon Go.

00:00:36.861 --> 00:00:39.730
They were able to go
from zero at launch

00:00:39.730 --> 00:00:43.490
to being bigger than Twitter
in five days, entirely

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:44.460
on Google Cloud.

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:46.120
Someone described it to me--

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.120
our role in sales--

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:50.380
as being like selling
guitars to rock stars.

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:52.880
You can really feel like you're
a part of something special.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:55.280
KELSEY DOMME: We're a provider
that's for the people.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:58.160
We're working directly
with our customers

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:00.730
that are using and getting the
most out of what we provide.

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:02.230
KETAN PATEL: I think
the folks we're

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:05.585
looking for have to be
passionate, driven, smart.

00:01:05.585 --> 00:01:07.422
We're looking for people
that are connected,

00:01:07.422 --> 00:01:08.880
that want to work
as a team, right?

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:10.040
This is a team play.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:10.920
JAMIE SHARP: It's
a little cheesy,

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:13.426
but the best part of the role
is unquestionably the team.

00:01:13.426 --> 00:01:15.800
Being able to work so closely
with account executives who

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.620
are the best of the
best in enterprise sales

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:20.430
has been a wonderful
learning opportunity.

00:01:20.430 --> 00:01:23.390
And being able to have front-row
seats to all the product

00:01:23.390 --> 00:01:26.100
development and innovation
that's going on in Google Cloud

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.160
is amazing.

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:28.170
KETAN PATEL: I think
the future is infinite.

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:30.180
When you think about how
connected this world is

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:32.735
becoming, you talk
about by adding devices

00:01:32.735 --> 00:01:33.787
into that as well.

00:01:33.787 --> 00:01:36.120
They'll be classification
around the Internet of Things.

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:37.410
The potential is infinite.

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:39.650
And this is a platform
that we call Cloud actually

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:41.730
provides the underpinning,
or the foundation,

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:43.400
on how these companies
will actually

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:45.020
deliver those services.

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:47.620
KELSEY DOMME: Were just now
offering it to the public.

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:50.400
It's the same infrastructure
we've been using internally

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.330
since the beginning of Google.

00:01:52.330 --> 00:01:54.234
But customers are
excited about it.

00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:55.650
They're excited
about the products

00:01:55.650 --> 00:01:57.650
we're talking to them
about, the solutions we're

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:58.850
talking to them about.

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:00.975
KETAN PATEL: If you want
to fundamentally transform

00:02:00.975 --> 00:02:03.390
and change what we're
doing and how technology's

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:07.990
consumed in today's marketplace,
this is a place to be.

